              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamugira ati: Samusooni, waafa, Abafilistia baakwita! Yaasisimuka, yaagira ati: Ka nshohore nyekunkumure nk'okwangye. Kwonka akaba atamanyire ku MUKAMA amurugireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilistia baamukwata, baamwihamu amaisho, baamushuumya Gaaza, baamukomesa emihama y'emiringa; yaaguma naakora omurimo gw'okusa omu nju y'embohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka eishokye rye ryagaruka ryamera bwanyima y'okumumwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
